Error [jet.UnknownField]: Fact read `reflect().layout` is compile-time only
  --> tests/ui/fact_layout_runtime.jet:7:26
    |
  7 |     size: Ring.reflect().layout.size
    |                          ^^^^^^
 Why: A fact is a value known before code generation; it never selects runtime behavior
 Fix: Write `FACT: #run Ring.reflect().layout`, then use `FACT` in this expression
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0302
